本仓库包含来源不同的若干部分，适用不同条款。全文不构成对上游作者的授权，
也不代表 FromSoftware / Bandai Namco。
This repository contains parts of different origins, under different terms. Nothing
below grants rights to the upstream code, and nothing here speaks for FromSoftware or
Bandai Namco.

