    start-map.sh 中的中英双语提示与 `tools/fetch_docs.py` 步骤
  - server/index.js、server/lib/bnd4.js 中新增的中文提示与安全注释

The following was created by the author of this fork (MiyauchiRenge) and is
licensed under the MIT License: README.md; docs/汉化说明.md; data/README.md;
